# gains: c3
# why: C3 robust: robust tune over 18 delay-varied plants (sim, PROPOSED): overshoot 3.61 cm, settle 0.84 s vs default 10.0 cm / 1.42 s (docs/lab/run-sheet-2026-10-16.md)
# C: robust tuned PID (C3): 0x01 locx/locy .3214/.0001/6.2937 + locxs/locys 3.2242/.0157/4.7283 (idx 24-35) written on
# the ground first, stop-and-wait (RAM: a reboot loses them). No ff shift. Sim (PROPOSED, 18 delay-varied plants):
# step overshoot 3.61 cm, settle 0.84 s vs default 10.0 cm / 1.42 s. Same track as lab_c_pid, gated pad landing, fusion 3.
# Fly it: fly lab_c_robust --once at >= 15.8 V resting. Plan: docs/lab/run-sheet-2026-10-16.md
campaign lab-c-robust
rate 100
log velocity_loops camera_fusion
slow 25 nn4 xy_ctrl mrac_3l ekf_states estimator_truth
set g_xy_ctrl_kind=0 g_traj_ff_shift_s=0 g_land_xy_gate_cm=10
takeoff 0.5
hold 3
goto x=0.4 y=0 z=0.5 dwell_s=4
hold 4
set traj_p.move_s=12 traj_p.hold_s=1
preset circle circ_r_cm=30
hold 2
preset figure8 f8_a_cm=30
hold 3
land
